<html lang="en">
<head><title>Oracle© Database Navigator plugin conflict</title></head>
<body style="${REGULAR_FONT_STYLE}">
<span style="font-size: 1.1em;">Oracle© Database Navigator Plugin Conflict</span><br>
<ul>
    <li><b>Oracle© Database Navigator</b> (DBN) - Oracle© database plugin</li>
    <li><b>Database Tools and SQL</b> - JetBrains bundled plugin</li>
</ul>
<u>DBN</u> detected that the
<u>Database Tools and SQL</u> plugin is also installed.
Both plugins provide similar database functionality. Having both plugins installed can lead
to an ambiguous and sometimes conflicting user experience.<br><br>

<u>DBN</u> is not a complementary product to <u>Database Tools and SQL</u>,
and the two plugins do not integrate with each other.

<br><br>
Choose how DBN should continue.
<br>
<br>
</body>
</html>
